<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Sign Up - Privacy Vault</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/favicon.ico">
  <link
  rel="stylesheet"
  href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.css"
/>


  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 32px 20px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top left, #738ffe 0, #5a6ff0 25%, #5e5ce6 50%, #6a4fd3 75%, #5b3fb4 100%);
      color: #fff;
    }

    .page-container {
      max-width: 1100px;
      width: 100%;
    }

    .page-header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .page-title {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 8px;
      font-size: 26px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .page-title-icon {
      width: 32px;
      height: 32px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .page-subtitle {
      margin-top: 6px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
    }

    .cards-row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.1fr) minmax(0, 0.9fr);
      gap: 24px;
      align-items: stretch;
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .cards-row {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }
.bi::before,
[class^="bi-"]::before,
[class*=" bi-"]::before {
  font-family: "bootstrap-icons" !important;
  font-style: normal;
}
    .card {
      border-radius: 18px;
      box-shadow: 0 18px 45px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.45);
      overflow: hidden;
      background: #fff;
    }

    .card-inner {
      padding: 26px 28px 24px;
      height: 100%;
    }

    /* LEFT card: form */

    .card-title {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #111827;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .card-subtitle {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #6b7280;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .form-group { margin-bottom: 16px; }
    label {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      color: #374151;
      font-weight: 500;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    input {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 10px 11px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
      font-size: 13px;
      background: #f9fafb;
      transition: border-color 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s, background 0.2s;
    }

    input:focus {
      outline: none;
      border-color: #6366f1;
      background: #ffffff;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.25);
    }

    .hint {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: #9ca3af;
      margin-top: 4px;
    }

    .form-row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .password-strength {
      margin-top: 6px;
      padding: 8px 10px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 11px;
      background: #f3f4ff;
      color: #4b5563;
    }

    .strength-bar {
      width: 100%;
      height: 4px;
      background: #e5e7eb;
      border-radius: 999px;
      margin-top: 4px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .strength-fill {
      height: 100%;
      width: 0%;
      transition: width 0.3s, background-color 0.3s;
    }

    .strength-fill.weak { width: 33%; background-color: #f97373; }
    .strength-fill.medium { width: 66%; background-color: #fbbf24; }
    .strength-fill.strong { width: 100%; background-color: #22c55e; }

    .checkbox-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .checkbox-row input[type="checkbox"] {
      margin-top: 3px;
    }

    .checkbox-row label {
      margin-bottom: 0;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #4b5563;
      font-weight: 400;
    }

    .checkbox-row a {
      color: #6366f1;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .checkbox-row a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

    .btn-primary {
      width: 100%;
      margin-top: 12px;
      padding: 11px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: none;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1 0%, #8b5cf6 100%);
      color: #ffffff;
      display: inline-flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      transition: transform 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease, opacity 0.15s;
    }

    .btn-primary:hover {
      transform: translateY(-1px);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(55, 65, 81, 0.25);
    }

    .btn-primary:disabled {
      opacity: 0.65;
      cursor: not-allowed;
      transform: none;
      box-shadow: none;
    }

    .error {
      color: #b91c1c;
      font-size: 11px;
      margin-top: 3px;
      display: none;
    }
    .error.show { display: block; }

    .alert {
      padding: 9px 10px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      font-size: 12px;
      display: none;
    }
    .alert.show { display: block; }
    .alert-success {
      background: #ecfdf5;
      color: #166534;
      border: 1px solid #bbf7d0;
    }
    .alert-error {
      background: #fef2f2;
      color: #b91c1c;
      border: 1px solid #fecaca;
    }

    .loading {
      margin-top: 8px;
      display: none;
      text-align: center;
      color: #4f46e5;
      font-size: 12px;
    }
    .spinner {
      display: inline-block;
      width: 18px;
      height: 18px;
      border: 2px solid #eef2ff;
      border-top: 2px solid #4f46e5;
      border-radius: 50%;
      animation: spin 0.9s linear infinite;
      margin-right: 6px;
    }
    @keyframes spin { 0% { transform: rotate(0deg); } 100% { transform: rotate(360deg); } }

    .form-footer {
      margin-top: 12px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #6b7280;
    }

    .form-footer a {
      color: #4f46e5;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    .form-footer a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

    /* RIGHT card: security features */

    .security-card {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #16a34a 0%, #22c55e 40%, #10b981 100%);
      color: #ecfdf5;
    }

    .security-inner {
      height: 100%;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      padding: 26px 28px 24px;
    }

    .security-heading {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .security-heading i {
      font-size: 20px;
      background: rgba(15, 118, 110, 0.18);
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 6px;
    }

    .security-heading h2 {
      font-size: 18px;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .security-lead {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #d1fae5;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .feature-list {
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .feature-item {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 8px;
      font-size: 13px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .feature-item i {
      margin-top: 2px;
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .feature-item span {
      color: #f0fdf4;
    }

    .how-card {
      margin-top: auto;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: rgba(6, 95, 70, 0.25);
      border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.4);
      padding: 10px 12px;
      font-size: 11px;
      color: #dcfce7;
    }

    .how-card-title {
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="page-container">
    <div class="page-header">
      <div class="page-title">
        <div class="page-title-icon">🔐</div>
        <span>Privacy‑First Data Vault</span>
      </div>
      <div class="page-subtitle">
        Your personal data, encrypted and under your control
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="cards-row">

      <!-- LEFT: Create account card -->
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-inner">
          <div class="card-title">Create Account</div>
          <div class="card-subtitle">
            30‑character username, strong password, and secure email to activate your vault.
          </div>

          <div class="alert alert-error" id="errorAlert"></div>
          <div class="alert alert-success" id="successAlert"></div>

          <form id="signupForm">
            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="username">Username</label>
              <input type="text" id="username" name="username" placeholder="3–30 characters, letters, numbers, dots, hyphens, underscores only" required>
              <div class="error" id="usernameError"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="email">Email</label>
              <input type="email" id="email" name="email" placeholder="you@example.com" required>
              <div class="error" id="emailError"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="form-row">
              <div class="form-group">
                <label for="firstName">First Name</label>
                <input type="text" id="firstName" name="firstName" placeholder="First name">
              </div>
              <div class="form-group">
                <label for="lastName">Last Name</label>
                <input type="text" id="lastName" name="lastName" placeholder="Last name">
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="password">Password</label>
              <input
                type="password"
                id="password"
                name="password"
                placeholder="At least 8 characters with upper, lower, number & symbol"
                required>
              <div class="password-strength">
                <div class="strength-bar">
                  <div class="strength-fill" id="strengthFill"></div>
                </div>
                <p id="strengthText">Weak password</p>
              </div>
              <div class="error" id="passwordError"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="confirmPassword">Confirm Password</label>
              <input type="password" id="confirmPassword" name="confirmPassword" placeholder="Re‑enter your password" required>
              <div class="error" id="confirmPasswordError"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="form-group">
              <div class="checkbox-row">
                <input type="checkbox" id="terms" name="terms" required>
                <label for="terms">
                  I agree to the
                  <a href="#" target="_blank">Terms of Service</a> and
                  <a href="#" target="_blank">Privacy Policy</a>.
                </label>
              </div>
              <div class="error" id="termsError"></div>
            </div>

            <button type="submit" class="btn-primary" id="submitBtn">
              <span>➕ Create Account</span>
            </button>

            <div class="loading" id="loading">
              <span class="spinner"></span>
              <span>Creating your account…</span>
            </div>
          </form>

          <div class="form-footer">
            Already have an account?
            <a href="/login">Login here</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- RIGHT: Security features card -->
      <div class="card security-card">
        <div class="security-inner">
          <div>
            <div class="security-heading">
              <i class="bi bi-shield-check"></i>
              <h2>Security Features</h2>
            </div>
            <p class="security-lead">
              Privacy Vault is architected with end‑to‑end encryption and zero‑knowledge principles.
            </p>

            <div class="feature-list">
              <div class="feature-item">
                <i class="bi bi-lock-fill"></i>
                <span>AES‑256 encryption for all personal data</span>
              </div>

              <div class="feature-item">
                <i class="bi bi-eye-slash"></i>
                <span>Zero‑knowledge architecture – we can't see your data</span>
              </div>

              <div class="feature-item">
                <i class="bi bi-share"></i>
                <span>Selective disclosure – share only what you choose</span>
              </div>

              <div class="feature-item">
                <i class="bi bi-key"></i>
                <span>Your password is your encryption key</span>
              </div>

              <div class="feature-item">
                <i class="bi bi-phone"></i>
                <span>Two‑factor authentication support</span>
              </div>

              <div class="feature-item">
                <i class="bi bi-graph-up"></i>
                <span>Complete audit trail of data access</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="how-card">
            <div class="how-card-title">How it works</div>
            <div>
              1. Your data is encrypted with your password before storage<br>
              2. Only you can decrypt and view your information<br>
              3. Create secure disclosures to share specific data<br>
              4. Maintain complete control over your privacy
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

  <script src="../../js/signup.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
